      "key_point": "S3.K1",
      "question": "Why is the transformation from a local coordinate system to a world coordinate system necessary when constructing a scene?",
      "answer": "Each object is defined individually in its own local system. Transformation allows all these objects to be assembled and defined within a single, common scene coordinate system."
