{
  "recap": "Pointing-based selection uses a virtual ray extended into the distance to indicate a desired object. This ray can be controlled using various body parts, such as the hand, head movement, or eye gaze. To overcome precision issues inherent in basic ray casting, advanced methods like bend cast and depth ray have been developed.",
